Matrix u0
Matrix s0
Matrix u1
Matrix s1
Matrix u2
Matrix s2
Note initial
Note decay0
Note decay1
Note rec
Note masklabel
Note mask
Note parallel
Note chunk
Note local
Note size
Note readout
Label u0 $U_{0}$
Label s0 $S_{0}$
Label u1 $U_{1}$
Label s1 $S_{1}$
Label u2 $U_{2}$
Label s2 $S_{2}$
Label initial $0$
Label decay0 $\alpha$
Label decay1 $\alpha$
Label rec $S_t=\alpha S_{t-1}+U_t$
Label masklabel $M$
Label mask $\begin{bmatrix}1&0&0\\\alpha&1&0\\\alpha^2&\alpha&1\end{bmatrix}$
Label parallel $O=(QK^\top\odot M)V$
Label chunk $S_{\mathrm{out}}=\alpha^n S_{\mathrm{in}}$
Label local $+\sum_{t=0}^{n-1}\alpha^{n-1-t}U_t$
Label size "one chunk of n updates"
Label readout $U_t=k_t v_t^\top\qquad o_s=q_s^\top S_s$
